<title>SPAIN: Spain April jobless rate 13.6 pct - agency.</title>
<headline>Spain April jobless rate 13.6 pct - agency.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of registered unemployed in Spain fell by some 40,000 people in April to stand at a monthly rate of 13.6 percent, the Europa Press agency reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>No one at the Labour Ministry was immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>In March the jobless rate was 13.89 percent.</p>
<p>Quoting &quot;informed sources&quot; the agency said total unemployed will be below 2.19 million when the data are released on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
